TATTOO STAT BONUSES

Tattoos in SneezyMUD can provide stat bonuses when worn on unequipped body slots.
These bonuses are based on animal and color keywords found in the tattoo description.

<g>HOW IT WORKS<1>
- Tattoos only provide bonuses when the body slot has NO equipment worn
- Bonuses scale with your level: +1 per 10 levels (minimum +1 at level 1-9)
- Only the FIRST animal and FIRST color found in each tattoo apply
- Multiple tattoos on different unequipped slots will stack their bonuses

